.mca_resource_pane_title
  Destroy audio?
  .mca_form_data_label_destroy= audio.title

%ul.mca_form_destroy_explanation
  %li Audio will be removed from album and event tracklists.
  %li <em>Imported</em> audio files will remain in the file system.
  %li <em>Uploaded</em> audio attachment(s) will be deleted.

.mca_form_warning
  This action can not be undone.

= form_with(model: [:admin, audio], method: :delete, local: true, class: :mca_form) do |f|
  .mca_form_actions
    = f.submit 'Destroy Audio', data: { confirm: 'Are you sure?' },  class: :mca_form_destroy
